Error [E0971]: the discovered module `<TMP>/modeval-find-liftability/./modules/nested.jet` has its own `imports:`
 Why: a module found by `find(…)` may not import (the liftability law, U4) — modules only contribute to the merged whole, they never import each other; nesting `find` would make composition explode
 Fix: remove the `imports:` from this module; declare all `find(…)` directives in the top-level env.jet
